---
import BaseLayout from '../components/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="音乐"><header class="page-head"><p class="eyebrow">Listening room / Violin’s Listening Room</p><h1>把感受，<br/>留在声音里。</h1><p>原创歌曲、歌词与声音实验。以主题选集编排值得慢慢听完的作品，歌词、创作手记与影像在音乐站里展开。</p></header><section class="record"><div class="disc" aria-hidden="true"><span>violin<br/><small>SIDE A · ORIGINALS</small></span></div><div><p class="eyebrow">Violin’s Listening Room</p><h2>音乐作品选集</h2><p>选一张主题唱片，跟着曲序慢慢听。<br/>在需要时，展开歌词与创作手记。</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="https://violin-music.pages.dev" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">进入专辑听室 ↗</a><a href="/works/dingying-fix" class="button secondary">看声音如何成为影像 →</a></div><p class="small">将在新窗口打开音乐站；播放由你开始。</p></div></section></BaseLayout>
<style>.record{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:65px;align-items:center;padding:40px 0}.disc{width:min(100%,400px);aspect-ratio:1;border-radius:50%;background:repeating-radial-gradient(#27251f 0 2px,#171611 3px 5px);display:grid;place-items:center;box-shadow:12px 14px 0 #e4dfd3}.disc span{background:var(--or);color:var(--paper);width:36%;aspect-ratio:1;border-radius:50%;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font:italic 32px var(--serif)}.disc small{font:8px var(--mono);margin-top:8px}h2{font:700 34px var(--serif);margin:20px 0}p{font-size:15px;line-height:2;color:var(--quiet)}.small{font-size:12px;margin-top:22px}@media(max-width:720px){.record{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:45px}.disc{width:80%;margin:auto}}</style>
